/201902/2019022015455704.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">“落其实者思其树，饮其流者怀其源。”</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">月</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>27</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">日、</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>28</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">日，我校顺利举行了</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">年寒假“饮水思源·我的大学”优秀毕业生回访母校宣讲咨询活动。这些初入大学，一方面对升学有着深刻体会，另一方面对大学有着初步感受的学长们，为大家介绍了各自的高校与所在专业，带学弟学妹们更直观、深入地了解大学，明晰方向，同时设置摊位供学生和家长面对面一对一咨询。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">首先让我们来到主会场的现场看一看吧！</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US>|</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">主会场·养新书藏二号厅<SPAN lang=EN-US>|<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">月</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>27</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">日下午，来自<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: red">武汉大学、南京大学、同济大学、南开大学、哈尔滨工业大学、厦门大学、中山大学、北京航空航天大学、华中科技大学、华东师范大学</SPAN></B>等近</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>50</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">所高校的一中毕业学子回到了母校。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">咨询场面火爆，心切的学生和家长们把现场围了个水泄不通，学哥学姐们积极聆听学生家长的问题与需求并认真解答；而场内，学哥学姐们充分输出“干货”，学生与家长们认真聆听宣讲，寻求适合的大学。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">此外，就读于<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: red">中国人民公安大学</SPAN></B>和<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: red">浙江警察学院</SPAN></B>的“小哥哥”“小姐姐”们身着制服来到现场，展现了他们的飒爽英姿。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">我们还在</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">月</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>28</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">日按专题设置了分会场，为目标明确的学子们提供更具针对性的宣讲与咨询。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
