<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">北京大学</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">蒋可旖：</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">（博雅计划<SPAN lang=EN-US>A+</SPAN>文科面试）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">注意，心态真滴很重要！别放弃自己，真的有可能逆风翻盘！</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">综合面试（占比较低，但比较好准备），如果一定要说有什么可以准备的话，希望大家对于自己提交的所有材料一定要有充分的了解，因为很大可能就是教授拿着你的简历（报名时提交的所有材料）来问你问题，包括但不仅限于你为什么选择这个专业这样子的可以提前准备好的问题。比如学姐在自己的材料里写有过模拟联合国经历，就被问到了对于美朝局势的看法，所以不妨在准备的时候，也试着对自己的材料做一点延伸（可以拜托家长</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">朋友进行模拟）。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">专业面试（占比较高，难度较大），我选的是文科类面试，两道题二选一，准备十五分钟（收手机，只给纸笔）。一题材料是清代章太炎的《联省自治虚置政府议》，另一题材料是美国为了改变对黑人的歧视而出现的矫枉过正的另一种不公平。两道题都分别设有</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5-6</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">小题，前</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2-3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">小题考察一些历史政治基础，后面的题目主要考察材料理解分析能力。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">清华大学</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">张悠然：</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">（高考英语备考经验分享）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">相信对于正常难度的试卷，如果要得高分，客观题大家的目标都是要争取不失分。这主要是靠大量的练习和总结，也可以在空闲时适当阅读一些难度更高的文本或听一些难度更高的内容提升语感。对于作文的话，非常重要的一点是练字。衡水体对提升作文分数亲测有效。小作文中规中矩，适当用一些高级词句即可。续写首先要保证以清晰美观的字体写完整篇文章，并且情节合理通顺（对时间把控的要求比较高），其次再着眼于词句的锤炼，切不可本末倒置。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">（额外的碎碎念）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">虽然统招时协和的录取分数比较高，但是学弟学妹们可以参加清华大学临床医学（协和）的自招</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">三一</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">领军获得幅度不小的降分。需要注意的是，协和的自招</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">三一</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">领军另设专业面试环节，主要考察学生是否具有较好的沟通能力、心理素质以及其他一些从医所需素养（去年曾让学生模拟缝针）。另外，通过任何途径进入清华大学后，开学时有针对全校本科新生（包括文科类专业）的二次招生，递交申请材料后进行面试，主要考察学生英语口语能力和其他从医所需素养，淘汰率约</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>50%</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">。但考虑到</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3+5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">直博试点班的推行，二次招生的名额可能会逐渐减少。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">清华大学</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">赵子瑜：</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">（高考数学备考经验）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">我认为高考数学主要是考察对基本概念的掌握程度，以及对基本技巧和方法的运用。在复习时，建议在熟练掌握课本中定义，定理和例题的基础上，加以适当的练习，对发现的薄弱部分，进行大量集中练习，直至对这部分内容有十足的把握，再通过模拟卷检验不足之处，如此循环，便可加深对基本概念的理解，熟练掌握技巧方法，从而顺利拿到大部分分数，得到一个不错的成绩。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">上海交通大学</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">张勉恒：</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">（三一经验）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">上海交通大学的笔试满分</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>300</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">，考试时间三个小时。理科只考数学与物理部分，难度大概会在高考和竞赛之间。所以，一些热力学与数论等非高考内容会出现，但是难度不大，非竞赛的同学建议在高考结束后自行学习一下，弄懂基本概念就可以了。其中数学与物理分别有</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>45</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">道题，分值是</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>30</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">道三分，</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>15</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">道</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">分，每题做错还会倒扣本题四分之一的分值。考试时间还是比较紧张的，需要有效把握。我在参加考试的时候做题顺序是数学三分题——物理三分题——物理四分题——数学四分题，遇到比较棘手的题目就先跳过，到最后再去做。所有的题目最好还是在交卷前填上答案，因为就数学期望而言，即使一个选项也没有排除，猜上去也不亏。交大近年理科笔试线在</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>170</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">与</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>180</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">左右，假如有对自己做题状况比较自信的同学也可以不猜。做题时要注意技巧和原理，计算量大的题目不多。交大的笔试过线就行，笔试分数不影响三一总分，面试考官手里也没有你的笔试成绩，所以刚好过线的同学们也可以放心地去准备面试。笔试会筛选出</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>900</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">多位同学进入面试。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"><FONT face=Calibri> <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">面试形式是</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>10 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">人为一组，再抽签分</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> 1-5,6-10 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">两个小组，分别去</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> A</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">、</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>B </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">两个教室参加面试，每组</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> 15-20 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">分钟。每个教室</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> 3 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">位考官。所有组都是同时进行的，组内没轮到的同学在大报告厅等候。三位考官的组成是有规律的，一般来说会有一名理工科教授和一名文史经管类专业的教授，另一位有一定概率会是英文教授。教授的总体年龄比较大，也十分和蔼，所以完全不必紧张，真诚地和他们交流就完全</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>OK</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">了。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>AB</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">两组中第一个问题都是让你做自我介绍一到三分钟（具体时间看考官，建议事先列一下提纲），在此同时考官们会仔细看你的材料，之后就你的材料提出问题。以下是一些可能就此问到的面试题：为什么选择交大？你的第一志愿是工科试验班（大类），有想过以后具体读什么吗？（会根据你的回答再提问，专业方面问得挺细的，不知道的只能说不了解了，不建议强行瞎扯！）你对大学和将来有什么规划？你有经历过什么不愉快的事吗？你没有拿过竞赛，你如何证明你的数学、物理能力是优秀的？我刚刚听说你要报考交大密院，为什么？你知道密院机械和交大机械有什么区别吗？你说你会关注一些机械方面的东西，那工业</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4.0</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">是什么？你知道国产圆珠笔芯的事情吗？你平时用过共享单车吗？你知道万一骑车出车祸，责任怎么分配吗？当然还有另外一些问题是我们必须准备的，比如对学校校史的了解，还有对你自己家乡的了解。就有教授问我，会不会背陆游和唐婉的钗头凤，臭豆腐是怎么制的等等。平时的积累就显得十分重要了。在面试不崩盘的情况下，高考在全省</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">名内都是很有希望的；假如高考能到全省</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>800</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">名内，几乎交大就能躺进了（</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>18</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">届一名学长带着惨不忍睹的面试分都进了）。所以学弟学妹们对自己要有信心。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">上海交通大学</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">斯丹婷：</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">（三一经验）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">上交初审不严苛，笔试有一定难度。理科考数学加物理（全单选），我觉得数学比物理难。还是不要在一道题上浪费太多时间吧，最好能做完。至于猜不猜嘛，反正答错扣</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1/4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">分。题目难度还是比较体谅人的，超纲度并不算大，所以哪怕像我一样半年没学物理的小可爱们也不用太担心呀。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">至于面试，上交的问题偏个人向，会考虑你的材料（相信我，不管多水的比赛，材料越丰富越好），然后会有自我介绍，会问你的爱好理想什么的，还会有英语回答和学科问题（答错了也不用害怕，老师还是很</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>nice</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">的）。也许我比较幸运吧，没碰到那些很坑的题目，但是请相信，当你遇到自己无法解决的题目的时候，你对待它的反应和态度很多时候比答案更重要。上交的面试会有两个房间，一个偏学术一个偏生活。个人感觉学术房更加难一点吧。老师们在出题的时候会有很大的发挥空间，所以拿到脑洞题也没什么可以奇怪的了。备考的话了解学校，了解专业，然后研究一下自己的材料，想想可能会被问的问题。临场发挥不论碰到什么都不要乱了阵脚，要相信你由于紧张可能出现的种种状况其实都是在面试官意料之中的，你只要做好自己就可以了。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">上海交通大学</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">谢腾飞：</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">（三一经验）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">按照</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2018</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">年的政策，交大的三一资格可以通过校荐和自荐两种渠道获得，校荐要求你在学校报名交大三一的所有人中排名前</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>100</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">，自荐的话没有硬性要求，只要你能体现自己的优秀就行。总体来说，交大的初审难度不大。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">笔试大概在高考后一周进行，但具体还是要关注官方渠道（微信公众号</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">上交大），理科专业的笔试考数学和物理，各</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>45</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">题，答错扣</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1/4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">。难度的话，物理在高考和初赛之间，数学也是稍高于高考，我本人是学物理竞赛的，物理都会做，数学是完全蒙了三题，个人以为难度不算特别大，而且笔试成绩对后续没有影响，只要你过了就行。推荐资料的话，物理《更高更妙的物理》（沈晨，浙江大学出版社），数学《数学那玩意——自主招生秘籍》（韩旭，浙江大学出版社）。仅仅作为参考，学有余力的同学可以做下，我也不确定是否会有帮助。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">面试不出意外还是在交大的陈瑞球楼进行。根据我去年的经历，先进行分组，一组</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>11</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">人，组内又分成</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">人和</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">人两部分，面试教室有两个（这里用</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>A,B</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">作为代号），</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">人部分先在</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>A</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">面试，同时</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">人部分在</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>B</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">面试，然后交换。对个人而言，是两轮三对一，</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>15mins</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">的面试。老师会先让你作自我介绍（一分钟或三分钟，看老师），然后根据你的材料，介绍等提问。两间教室一个偏学术化，另一个偏生活化，以我个人的经历学术房难度比较大，老师也感觉比较凶。老师提的问题范围很广，基本上他想问什么就问什么。学术房的问题，比如用一个字或词概括绍兴，螃蟹为什么是横着走，知道那些数据可以得出行星的运行周期；生活房的问题，平时做哪些运动，看书是那句话或片段印象最深刻，要是这个专业考不上怎么办（此处我回答了之后转专业，大家可以提前了解一下转专业的事）。我有同学还遇到了英语问题，这方面大家可以留意一下。我个人的感觉，面试是很难准备的，很多经历、经验也很难推广，说这些也是希望大家对整个过程能有所了解，减少些不必要的紧张，个人建议，面试是把你个人的特点展示给老师，告诉老师你优秀在哪里，所以没有必要夸大自己，当然也不要直接暴露自己的缺点（我有次被问到什么特点在班级里一提起大家就会想到我，我诚实作答屁话多。。。真是佛了）。总的来说，面试时别紧张，不要出现卡壳，老师提问你积极、配合地回答，展示出自己的优点，特点。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">浙江大学</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">学哥学姐们：</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">（三一经验）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">从根本上来说，报考前要充分了解政策（浙大官网），明白浙大的三一对你来说的定位是什么（冲击、保底还是非去浙大不可），要探索自身的兴趣，了解自己究竟想读什么专业，对未来的规划是什么（读研、出国还是本科毕业就工作），了解你有兴趣的专业究竟学些什么，将来干些什么（千万不要根据专业的名字想当然，比如浙大有生命科学、生物工程、生物医学工程、生物食品工程）。其次，要明白还是高考为主，切忌本末倒置。最后，笔试要保证会做的拿分，毕竟真的“大佬”来浙大三一其实不多，相信自己！面试要敢于表达，一定要真情实感，多去了解一下相关专业的院士有哪些、目前浙大该学科的主要研究方向有哪些。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">希望通过这次“饮水思源·我的大学”宣讲咨询活动，同学们可以拥有更明晰的目标，和更强大的前进动力。在这里，毕业的学哥学姐们也有些话想对你们说，请收下这许多份冬日里的温暖吧<SPAN style="COLOR: red">&#10084;</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">为天地立心，为生民立命，为往圣继绝学，为万世开太平。愿绍兴一中的学弟学妹们认真学习，打好基础，仰望星空，脚踏实地，将自我价值与家国命运联系起来，将博雅的薪火代代相传。我们在未名湖畔博雅塔旁等你们来！</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（北京大学 任轩笛 蒋可旖 沈定宇 严明义）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">愿你在迷茫时，坚信你的珍贵；爱你所爱，行你所行。听从你心，无问西东。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（清华大学的学长们）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">桃李曾沐，细无声。从博雅一中到求是园，盼你，望你，等你，在湖光风动摇的启真湖畔，在秋风微度的紫金港里，我们的缘分岂止高二远足。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（浙江大学的学长们）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">日月光华，有你的星辰，九月光华楼下，光草柔软，清风怡人，一起来躺着数云朵吧。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（复旦大学 王启文）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">高三的这段时间是辛苦的，但也确实充实的，并且也可能是你以班级这样一个集体的形式生活、学习的最后一段时光，所以务必努力，务必珍惜。祝愿各位学弟学妹能取得理想的成绩，考入心仪的大学。（</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">上海交通大学 谢腾飞）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">愿学弟学妹们乘风破浪，披荆斩棘，征服那片属于你们的星辰大海。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（上海交通大学 孙宇超）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">每一个不曾起舞的日子都是对生命的辜负。愿学弟学妹们能珍惜身边的每一个人，活一场青春无悔；也愿学弟学妹们在迷茫、沮丧时，追随内心的召唤，砥砺前行。须百折不挠，才不负此生。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（北京航空航天大学 韩程凯）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">孔雀东南飞，冀大学及第；学子十年苦，铭师亲恩重——金榜题名！</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（东南大学 沈星航）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">愿能无悔地丢掉课本，愿六月能善待你们，愿高考顺意。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（华东师范大学 孙涵彦 毛婷婷）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">祝</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">届的学弟学妹们能够不忘初心，奋斗到最后一课。希望你们能以梦为马，不负韶华。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（河海大学 王佳呈）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">对未来的真正慷慨，是把一切献给现在。祝福你们！</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（中国地质大学<SPAN lang=EN-US>(</SPAN>武汉<SPAN lang=EN-US>) </SPAN>蒋郑鑫）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">很荣幸也很自豪能回到一中宣讲，真正来参加之后才感受到自己对于这个活动的热情，回答了家长犀利的提问也鼓励了想报名却犹豫不决的学弟学妹，能为学弟学妹未来的道路点亮一盏灯起到一点点帮助很让我心满意足。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（上海外国语大学 任宇颖）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">希望学弟学妹们能够坚持自己最初的目标，正确看待自己、评估自己，考上理想的学校。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（上海外国语大学 沈雨薇）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">每一天，愿你都是被梦想叫醒的。山高水长，等你续写。绍兴一中</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">届学弟学妹高考加油！</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（华中师范大学 钟正）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">没有天才的灵光，胸怀凡人的倔强；囊萤映雪，匡衡偷光，破釜沉舟，柳暗花明；亲爱的学弟学妹们，有志者，事竟成，头顶同一米阳光，奋斗的征程才是最美的青春！</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（浙江师范大学 赵一聪）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">大学生活也许没有想象中那么轻松，坚持自己的方向即可，不必国恩被他人所约束。希望大家选择喜欢的专业，走进适合自己的学校！</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（浙江师范大学 陈程）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">仰望星空，脚踏实地；不忘初心，勇敢前行。愿你们都能去往自己的天地，实现最初的梦想。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（华侨大学 傅幸怡）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">风里雨里，三生三世等你。一中学弟学妹们高考加油！</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（浙江警察学院的师兄师姐们）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">休业式结束后的学弟学妹们本该就此开始寒假生活，却还是来参加老学长们并不那么专业的宣讲，有这样的热情，何愁分数不高，功名不就！</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（北京中医药大学 陈天韵）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">希望高三学弟学妹们能秉持求真的态度，加油冲刺，在六月取得自己满意的成绩，考入心仪的大学。此外，也希望每一位一中学子能珍惜在高中的校园时光，不忘初心，饮水思源，不管是现在还是将来。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（浙江中医药大学 殷心怡）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">母校睽违已久，再见时雀跃又情怯。在人群中一遍又一遍地介绍答疑，只是希望尽自己的力量鼓励学弟学妹向着梦想和太阳全力奔跑。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1">（温州医科大学 寿一点）</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; COLOR: #4f81bd; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-themecolor: accent1" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 24pt 0pt 0cm; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">愿今日学子，记住内心澎湃的自己，拥有一段正好的青春。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: right; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all" class=MsoNormal align=right><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
